#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1299
msgid "When importing posts, the plugin first checks whether an image already exists in your Media Library. Choose how it should handle matching existing media."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1306
msgid "Verify Only Fallback Matches (Recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1309
msgid "Best for most websites. If the original upload path is found, the image is reused instantly. When only the filename matches, the plugin performs one extra safety check before reusing it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1315
msgid "Verify All Matches (PRO)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1318
msgid "Checks every reused image before linking it. Recommended if your Media Library has changed over time or you want the highest level of matching accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1324
msgid "Always Download Fresh (PRO)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1327
msgid "Skips existing Media Library images and downloads fresh copies from the source website whenever available. Best if you always want newly imported files."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1335
msgid "⭐ PRO: Link Reused Media to Imported Post"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1339
msgid "When an existing image is reused, this option also links it to the imported post. The \"Uploaded To\" column in the Media Library will correctly show the imported post as the image owner."
