msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1350
msgid "✓ Run the System Test first to ensure your server can handle large files"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1351
msgid "✓ Enable \"Download missing images from original URLs\" if the source site is still online. This imports images directly without requiring a media ZIP, but may take longer."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1352
msgid "⭐ PRO: Choose how existing media is matched—verify fallback matches, verify every match for maximum accuracy, or always download fresh copies."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1353
msgid "⭐ PRO: Automatically link reused media to imported posts, updating the \"Uploaded To\" relationship in the Media Library."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1354
msgid "✓ Existing images with the same filename will be reused automatically"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-menu.php:1355
msgid "✓ If you enable \"Download missing images from original URLs\" and ensure the source site is live, media will be fetched directly from the original URLs. This means you won’t need to import media files separately, though the process may take additional time to download and complete."
